# Lowered 92 -> 85 (2026-08-08). 92 was calibrated when this package was a
# READER only. writer.go adds an error return on every bufio write, and bufio
# does not flush until 4 KiB or Close — so for any document a test would
# reasonably build, those branches are unreachable. They are covered where they
# can be (TestAFailureAtAnyPointInTheDocumentSurfaces drives a failing
# destination); the rest would need a test written to move a number rather than
# to establish a behaviour.
